================================================================================
Desktop app (src-tauri/)
================================================================================

The Windows, macOS and Linux apps additionally bundle Tauri 2 and
tauri-plugin-opener (MIT OR Apache-2.0) and the Rust crates listed in
src-tauri/Cargo.lock, which are MIT, Apache-2.0 or similarly permissively
licensed. Pages are displayed by the operating system's own web view
(WebView2 on Windows, WKWebView on macOS, WebKitGTK on Linux), which is not
bundled.

